# The operator's go-ahead: the part is on the table and the cell is clear (ADR-0071).
#
# Replaces the Enter keypress `cite_bringup.program.operator` asked for at a
# terminal. Accepted ONLY while the console is AWAITING_PART, which it enters
# only after reading the twin's mode as SIM; refused in every other state, so a
# confirmation sent early is never held over for a later question.
#
# Served under `/cite/<zone>/console/<NAME>` (ConsoleState.msg).

string NAME="confirm_part"
---
bool success   # the confirmation answered the question the console was asking
string detail  # or why it was refused
